  narrativeText: You wake up in your messy room and look out at the thick fog outside
    the window. Ever since the fog appeared, anyone who has walked into it has never
    been seen again. Naturally, although the water and electricity are still on,
    people can no longer obtain supplies from the outside world, and your home is
    down to its last few cans of food.
